\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces The CP$-$72\nobreakspace  {}2713 Band\nobreakspace  {}7 crossing inside its own control ensemble, in both executions. Histograms give the 512{} single-position control statistics of that window in execution\nobreakspace  {}1 (filled) and in the second block 2.05\,h later (outline); the two agree, which is the evidence that the datasets are comparable. Vertical lines mark $T_\star $ and the largest control in each. In execution\nobreakspace  {}2 the control annulus alone reaches 5.93, beyond the 5.81{} that raised the flag, while the star falls to 3.60.}}{20}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
